  "prefLabel": "Plc 805.01 Eligibility for Registration Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 805.01 Eligibility for Registration Renewal. To be eligible for renewal of a registration to practice ophthalmic dispensing, an individual shall:\n\n(a) Have completed not less than 8 hours of continuing education, as required by RSA 327-A:14 and as described in Plc 804.03;\n\n(b) Have paid all administrative and civil penalties imposed, if any; and\n\n(c) Meet the eligibility for renewal criteria specified in Plc 308.02.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 800) #13885 eff 4-15-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc800.html"
